things you're proposing, not open borders,

00:02:27.420 --> 00:02:28.970
but for a lot of the things you're talking
about.

00:02:28.970 --> 00:02:29.970
Yes.

00:02:29.970 --> 00:02:30.970
Speaker 3: OK.

00:02:30.970 --> 00:02:33.220
In terms of border security, though, how would
