00:02:40.590 --> 00:02:46.790
I mean, people are still able to like it's
mostly there to be able to prevent.

00:02:46.790 --> 00:02:50.310
I guess, like drug traffickers are coming
in, but they're still managing to come in

00:02:50.310 --> 00:02:54.370
