and industry.

00:02:54.370 --> 00:02:59.310
So I was just wondering, like in terms of
border security, how should we reframe that?

00:02:59.310 --> 00:03:02.780
So it's not just like a black hole that we're
just spending a lot of the taxpayer money

00:03:02.780 --> 00:03:03.780
