way that you're talking about.

00:03:32.520 --> 00:03:34.600
So we just need to be thinking about it.

00:03:34.600 --> 00:03:38.940
You're completely right that if you just change
one thing, it doesn't change the entire dynamic.

00:03:38.940 --> 00:03:40.620
We need to be thinking much bigger.

00:03:40.620 --> 00:03:42.780
Thank you, David.

00:03:42.780 --> 00:03:43.780
